msgid "Rootless mount"
msgstr ""

#: src/redoxfs.md:215
msgid ""
"A rootless mount grants full access to a partition to a specific user. It "
"can be configured using `setfacl`:"
msgstr ""

#: src/redoxfs.md:221
msgid "Then mount the disk without sudo:"
