#: src/redoxfs.md:235
msgid "Rootful mount"
msgstr ""

#: src/redoxfs.md:237
msgid ""
"A rootful mount allows sharing the mounted device with other users, and "
"standard file permissions apply. It can be mounted using `sudo`:"
msgstr ""

